Rubin, D. B. (1987). \emph{Multiple Imputation for Nonresponse in Surveys.} Wiley.

Barnard, J., & Rubin, D. B. (1999). Small-sample degrees of freedom with
multiple imputation. \emph{Biometrika}, 86(4), 948-955.
}
